      "title": "Sonatine movie review & film summary - Roger Ebert",
      "snippet": "\"Sonatine\" is the latest film to be released in this country by Takeshi Kitano, who wrote, directed and edited it-and stars in it under his acting name, Beat Takeshi. It arrives here only a month after \"Fireworks,\" his 1997 Venice Film Festival winner, but was made in 1993, the fourth of his seven films. He is the biggest star in Japan right now, and as a filmmaker one of the most ...",
